# The two large artifacts this directory carries are copies of
# bundles_dir/rtmo-posture-bundle/models/, which the repo root ignores for the
# same reason: ~400 MB of build output does not belong in git. They are here so
# the directory is self-contained on disk — re-copy them, or rebuild the engine
# with build/build_engine.py, on a fresh clone.
bundle/models/*.engine
bundle/models/*.onnx

results/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
